      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Each node = (N, Q, char).  On insert  Q = N.  Read = siblings by descending Q.  Delete reprojects the survivor’s Q into the deleted node’s slot.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each node = (N, Q, char).  On insert  Q = N.  Read = siblings by descending Q.  Delete reprojects the survivor’s Q into the deleted node’s slot.",
