      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Root cause is DELETE, not merge: deleting Q must UPDATE its child y’s Q into Q’s\nslot — i.e. y.Q < P.Q. Leaving y.Q = 20 is what breaks it.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Root cause is DELETE, not merge: deleting Q must UPDATE its child y’s Q into Q’s\nslot — i.e. y.Q < P.Q. Leaving y.Q = 20 is what breaks it.",
