      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Q must stay WITHIN the sibling bounds AND preserve order — that is what keeps survivors in place.\nSo Q can NOT be renumbered freely; density (rationals) is required → the id-size cost is real.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Q must stay WITHIN the sibling bounds AND preserve order — that is what keeps survivors in place.\nSo Q can NOT be renumbered freely; density (rationals) is required → the id-size cost is real.",
