      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "↑ they are Q’s: (2,3) = g’s slot = (sibling c’s Q, g’s Q);\n5/2 = its midpoint; (0,1) = x’s slot (floor 0, x’s Q=1)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9.600000000000001,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "↑ they are Q’s: (2,3) = g’s slot = (sibling c’s Q, g’s Q);\n5/2 = its midpoint; (0,1) = x’s slot (floor 0, x’s Q=1)",
